ne-video-cutter.com)%20(2).mp4","heroText":"Unlock exclusive science stories and expert insights. Enter your email to join Live Science Plus.","heroHeadline":"Good science for","heroHeadlineHighlight":"curious minds","premiumFeaturesNumber":"10","premiumMembersNumber":"25K","heroHowItWorkBgImage":"https:\/\/cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net\/flexiimages\/df5mvtnvds1765185646.jpeg","heroBadges":{"title":"Level One Badge","strapline":"Unlock your first badge","pictureUrl":"https:\/\/cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net\/flexiimages\/91pewzqw1l1765179034.svg","content":[{"title":"Science Quizzes","strapline":"Quick science quizzes for curious minds.","iconUrl":"https:\/\/cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net\/flexiimages\/auhzn95kfw1765178641.svg","link":"\/quizzes"},{"title":"Science Crosswords","strapline":"Science-themed crossword challenges.","iconUrl":"https:\/\/cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net\/flexiimages\/icuxplxvpc1765178921.svg","link":"\/tag\/science-crossword"}]},"FAQ":{"content":[{"title":"What is Live Science Plus?","mainText":"Live Science Plus is a free membership offering a variety of content and features, including commenting, games, user Q&As, and exclusive member-only content and rewards.","list":[]},{"title":"Is there a cost to join Live Science Plus?","mainText":"No, Live Science Plus is completely free. There are no hidden fees or charges.","list":[]},{"title":"What features do I get with Live Science Plus?","mainText":"As a free member, you'll have access to:","list":[{"title":"Commenting:","text":"Engage with other members and content creators by leaving comments on articles, discussions, and other posts."},{"title":"Games:","text":"Enjoy a selection of games available exclusively to our members."},{"title":"User Q&As:","text":"Participate in our community by asking questions and providing answers in the user Q&A section."},{"title":"Member-Only Content:","text":"Access exclusive articles, videos, and other content available only to members."},{"title":"Deals and Discounts:","text":"Take advantage of special offers and deals from our partners."},{"title":"Membership to other Future brands:","text":"Your login gives you access to all our brands with the same login details."}]},{"title":"How do I sign up for Live Science Plus?","mainText":"You can sign up by clicking \"Sign in\" at the top-right of the website, then selecting the \"Sign Up\" tab on the registration form. You will need to provide a valid email address and password.","list":[]},{"title":"Is my personal information safe?","mainText":"Yes, we take your privacy seriously. Your personal information is protected and will not be shared with third parties without your consent. Please refer to our Privacy Policy for more details.","list":[]},{"title":"Can I upgrade my membership in the future?","mainText":"Currently, all features are available for free. We may introduce premium features or options in the future, but our core offerings will always remain free for members.","list":[]},{"title":"How do I access member-only content?","mainText":"Once you are logged in, you can access all content on the website via the navigation and user account page.","list":[]},{"title":"What if I forget my password?","mainText":"If you forget your password, you can use the \"Forgot Password\" link on the login page to reset it. Instructions will be sent to your registered email address.","list":[]}]},"Features":{"strapline":"Three powerful ways to explore deeper science, every day.","content":[{"title":"TEST YOUR KNOWLEDGE","category":"GAMES & CHALLENGES","subtitle":"Fun science quizzes, puzzles and brain-teasers that spark curiosity.","strapline":"Try a range of interactive challenges:","image":"https:\/\/cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net\/flexiimages\/ldveeug6uy1764928312.png","list":[{"title":"Quizzes","strapline":"Test your knowledge with engaging quizzes","icon":"https:\/\/cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net\/flexiimages\/ryyffx3m3i1764928415.svg"},{"title":"Puzzles","strapline":"Challenge yourself with brain teasers"